<title>POLAND: Polish 182-day NBP-bill yield flat at 22.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish 182-day NBP-bill yield flat at 22.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 17 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills after banks bid for 252 million, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The maximum yield of the paper held flat at 22.50 percent, the average yield was also 22.50.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
